      "writtenOn": "2025-09-03T11:41:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "zram is an \"unprotected\" GKI module, which means it can be overridden by partner implementations. See https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/modules#unprotected-GKI-module\n\nThis means that to use it, the symbols need to be part of the KMI, so a symbol list update is required - and the platform must be able to gracefully deal with the case where the ioctl isn\u0027t implemented by partner version of zram.ko.",
      "parentUuid": "eb08035d_0d6b74c2",
